proposed_definition_changes.proposed:
For \((r_{0n},r_{1n},r_{en})\in[0,\bar r]^3\), define
\[
\mathfrak R_n^{(2)}
=\inf_{T\in\mathcal T_n}
\left[
\sup_{(P,m_0,m_1,p)\in\mathcal M_n}
E_P\!\left\{
\left(T(O^{(n)},m_0,m_1,p,r_{0n},r_{1n},r_{en})-\tau(P)\right)^2
\right\}
\right]^{1/2}.
\]

